Package: apassy
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Apassy <https://github.com/wydrox/apassy/issues>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Suggests: tailscale, systemd
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/wydrox/apassy
Description: Apassy node without a window
 The Apassy node runs on a Linux machine of your tailnet: the relay of the
 questions, the feed, the access requests, and relay sync of your devices,
 and a team host for `apassy team`. The Mac and the iPhone reach it over
 Tailscale behind a pinned certificate. Nothing listens on 0.0.0.0.
 .
 After the installation, run `apassy up` as your own user (not as root).
